                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c66e4dac-21f9-350c-8769-900cb0b11781",
                        "entry_id": "aa6fa59d-7647-34d6-9471-c87ef39f7d8a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à la quintessence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3251110c-6b0c-4cca-813b-ef1fdf78edff",
                                "sense_id": "c66e4dac-21f9-350c-8769-900cb0b11781",
                                "text": "Le mot de pensée, pour lui [Lambert] le produit quintessentiel de la volonté, désignait aussi le milieu où naissaient les idées auxquelles elle sert de substance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bec5c86c-7bbc-41a7-be2d-08fc3774c448",
                                "sense_id": "c66e4dac-21f9-350c-8769-900cb0b11781",
                                "text": "Parler d’un gémissement morne et sans âme, d’un hurlement d’épouvante poussé par un chœur de damnés, ne suffirait pas à exprimer sa hideur quintessentielle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "231f5744-db24-48da-9a3a-3f09cea3fce7",
                                "sense_id": "c66e4dac-21f9-350c-8769-900cb0b11781",
                                "text": "La Corse serait-elle une synthèse supérieure et quintessentielle de la civilisation ? Un propos sibyllin d’Emmanuel Macron pourrait le laisser croire : « La Corse a une identité bien à elle. Elle est corse, française, européenne et méditerranéenne… »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28ab753b-e10a-41c5-b4df-84a789d4a225",
                                "sense_id": "c66e4dac-21f9-350c-8769-900cb0b11781",
                                "text": "Fukushima a représenté un moment quintessentiel de la convergence entre les luttes écologiques et antiautoritaires."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "626143d0-f8ce-45cd-ae35-dc5e0276340e",
                        "source_entry_id": "aa6fa59d-7647-34d6-9471-c87ef39f7d8a",
                        "source_sense_id": "c66e4dac-21f9-350c-8769-900cb0b11781",
                        "target_lang_word": "quintessential",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quintessential",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3a5cd3b-d528-3b94-9137-1bc480981536",
                                        "entry_id": "d351b1fb-5c16-3d5e-9085-d81e75f85b39",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of the nature of a quintessence (in all senses); being or relating to the ultimate essence of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "115915d9-0208-47d9-b0e7-04166695006e",
                                                "sense_id": "d3a5cd3b-d528-3b94-9137-1bc480981536",
                                                "text": "The krogan evolved in a lethal ecology. Over millions of years, the grim struggle to survive larger predators, virulent disease, and resource scarcity on their homeworld, Tuchanka, turned the lizards into quintessential survivors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ea975ac-ab89-4540-b7a0-037dd78ec757",
                                                "sense_id": "d3a5cd3b-d528-3b94-9137-1bc480981536",
                                                "text": "Twin Tracks is the old-fashioned autobiography of a quintessential Englishman, evocative of an age when you took halibut oil for rickets and sportsmen were amateurs who trained in their lunch breaks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d8ce6a7-deb8-4148-8a9b-6caa33bc2464",
                                                "sense_id": "d3a5cd3b-d528-3b94-9137-1bc480981536",
                                                "text": "I live in a quintessential (Australian) building type myself - a high-set 'Queenslander' on Captain Cook's tropical Cape Tribulation coast - and some of the details I love most about it are its Deco influences - [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "quintessential",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e984e0fa-057e-392f-bea7-3f73887610ec",
                                        "entry_id": "b2aa640f-9c60-30f5-8f2d-cc47b20409f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fundamental essence of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d57cadd9-6cbf-461d-9d85-b798eb560a07",
                                                "sense_id": "e984e0fa-057e-392f-bea7-3f73887610ec",
                                                "text": "A final aspect of the focus argument concerns the potential for integration to highlight the quintessentials of each subject."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
